</facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1079098" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute>Viro Illustrissimo et <choice><abbr>Celeberr.<hi rend="sup">o</hi>imo</abbr><expan>Celeberrimo</expan></choice>
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Jo:</abbr><expan>Johanni</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoull<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></rs> Petrus Antonius <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr></salute></opener>
  <p><lb/>Quoniam heri <rs type="lostletter">Literas</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Der Brief vom 4. Oktober 1719, den <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-1089913338">Benedict Bernoulli</rs> an seinen Bruder <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-119166895">Nicolaus I Bernoulli</rs> schrieb, ist bislang nur indirekt bezeugt. In seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517026205501">Brief</rs> an Nicolaus vom 13. Oktober berichtet Michelotti, er habe das Schreiben auf Nachrichten über das Paket hin durchgesehen und nach Chiavenna weitergeleitet.</note> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089913338" type="person">Fratris</rs> Pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>clarissimi Agnati
      <lb/>Tui <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolai</rs> istic <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> 4 hujus mensis datas<add>, atque</add> ad me
      <lb/>perlatas legendo, null<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> <add>in iis</add> fuisse fact<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> mentio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nem vidi de fasciculo<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Gemeint ist das Paket mit dem Manuskript des ersten Teils von Michelottis Dissertation und seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515151805501">Brief</rs> vom 9. September 1719. Johann I Bernoulli bestätigte den Empfang im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515151405501">Brief</rs> vom 18. Oktober 1719.</note>, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> ad Te per <rs key="place_GEO-3173435" type="place">Medio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lan<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> diligentia Tabellarii miss<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> volebam, immo
      <lb/>miss<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> volui ante mens<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>, et quod superest: et pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice><pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>terea quandoquid<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> a Te Vir <choice><abbr>Illustriss.</abbr><expan>Illustrissime</expan></choice> nullam
      <lb/>ad meas litteras<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Michelotti hatte Bernoulli bereits im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515151705501">Brief</rs> vom 15. September und im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515151605501">Brief</rs> vom 6. Oktober 1719 um Nachricht über den Empfang des Manuskripts gebeten.</note> responsion<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> accepi, statuo
      <lb/>hac tertia vice ad Te scribere, Teque, uti ali<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>s
      <lb/>feci, orare ut protinus ad me scribas, mihi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>que confestim significes fascicul<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> comme<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>morat<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> acceperis nec ne. Nam qu<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> mea
      <lb/><rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">Dissertatio de separatione Fluidor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> in Cor<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>pore Animali</rs>, in illo eod<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> fasciculo <add>obsignato,</add>
      <lb/>et <choice><sic>tella</sic><corr>tela</corr></choice> cerea obducto contineatur, <add>nolo,</add>
      <lb/>si Diis placebit, ut evanescat. Spero Te jam
      <lb/>nunc ill<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> fascicul<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> accepisse, qua de re crasti<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>na die <rs key="place_GEO-3173435" type="place">Mediolan<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> perscrib<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> ad Illustrissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>m<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> Marchionissam <rs key="pers_DE-588-1221330748" type="person">Loaysam, Butintrochi</rs>,
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> scripsit, se ill<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> fascicul<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <rs key="place_GEO-3173435" type="place">Mediolano</rs>
      <lb/>ad Te misisse. Rogo itaque ut mihi
<pb facs="1079099" n="2"/>
      <lb/>respondeas, sive fascicul<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> acceperis, sive non
      <lb/>acceperis. Quod reliqu<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> est quum heri jam
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavio</rs> discesserit <choice><abbr>Illustriss.</abbr><expan>Illustrissimus</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatus</rs> Tuus istuc
      <lb/>profecturus, mitt<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> <rs key="place_GEO-3178829" type="place">Clavenn<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice></rs>, uti jussit, <rs type="lostletter">litte<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ras</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG"><rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-119166895">Nicolaus I Bernoulli</rs> bestätigte in seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517026105501">Brief</rs> vom 8. November 1719, dass er das Schreiben seines Bruders am Vortag in Basel erhalten hatte.</note> quas pro illo accepi.</p> <closer><salute>Tu interim
      <lb/>vale, mihique favere ne dedignare.</salute>
<dateline>Dab<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1719-10-13">13 Octobris 1719.</date></dateline></closer>
<pb facs="1079100" n="3" type="empty"/>
